WEBVTT
NOTE title: Sample talk (synthetic fixture, not a real person)
NOTE date: 2026-03-02

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Thanks for having me. I'm Sam Example, I run the platform team at Example Labs.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:14.000
The first lesson we learned the hard way is that you should ship the boring version first and measure it.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:22.000
Don't build the dashboard before anyone has asked a question the dashboard would answer.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:12.000
My rule now is one owner per metric, because a number with three owners has none.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:18.000
I think most teams over-invest in tooling and under-invest in writing down what they decided.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:08.000
Never let a migration run longer than a quarter without a date you are willing to say out loud.
